{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the resnet50 image encoder with imagenet_vit_l in a multimodal, multiprofile model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. The validation accuracy improved to 0.725 (from 0.713), suggesting the image encoder choice may influence performance, though the slight drop in validation F1 (0.685 vs. 0.695) introduces uncertainty. The exact contribution of the image encoder remains uncertain due to potential interactions with other components."
}

